# skills: Knockout Kick. Jian at level 25 (level index 24 pinned, battle MP pinned to 50), first temple
# battle. Special lists five skills; Right, Right is Knockout Kick (shot kk_list: 9, "Put one monster to
# sleep"). A opens the enemy grid, Right picks the second back-row enemy (battler 5), A casts: Jian leaps
# up and kicks without damage, the green ring shows on it, MP 50 -> 41, and its status goes 0 -> 1 (sleep;
# the game's own queue applies it after the action, with the flash and the Zzz). Next round the grid opens
# on it: the name bar reads its name and "Slp" (kk_tag); A is refused with "No effect!" (kk_refused),
# no MP is taken. Not shown: the turns it sleeps through and its waking (2 to 4 turns, or a hit).
# Battle records at 0x0228E860 (0x6C each; status in the low nibble of +0x08). The success roll is fixed by
# setting the game's random state (0x020A0238) each time the spell effect hook site (0x020503A0) runs:
# state 24 gives roll 3, under the 70 percent chance. Run with --save.
include boot_from_save
include cheats_strong
include warp6
include cheats_strong
pin u32 0x020B4664 24
pinptr u32 0x020B8620 0x18 50
execpoke 0x020503A0 u32 0x020A0238 24
wait 270
peek u32 0x020B8620 records
peek u32 0x020B8550 work
watch u32 0x0228e878 jian_mp
watch u8 0x0228ea18 status4
watch u8 0x0228ea84 status5
watch u8 0x0228eaf0 status6
watch u8 0x0228ebc8 status8
watch u8 0x0228ec34 status9
watch u8 0x0228eca0 status10
press A 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
shot kk_list
press A 8
wait 50
wait 30
press Right 8
wait 50
shot kk_grid
press A 8
wait 50
wait 40
shot kk_cast
wait 60
shot kk_ring
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 8 600
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 7 3000
wait 110
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 50
wait 30
shot kk_tag
press A 8
wait 50
shot kk_refused
wait 80
shot kk_after
